Package: bordercovid
Title: Compare COVID-19 Outcomes Across Border-Closure Strategies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Isha", "Mantri", email = "ishamantri20@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a cleaned dataset of COVID-19 case and mortality
    rates for countries that pursued strict border quarantine strategies
    alongside comparison countries that did not. Includes a summary
    function and a Shiny application for exploring how those outcomes
    differed across countries and across time periods.
